# Unified Clinical & Digital Lab Operating Workspace (DCOS 2.0)
## Master Architectural Blueprint & Exhaustive Permutations Plan

Consolidate the fragmented **Patient Record** (`/patients/[id]`) and **Digital Lab Case** (`/cases/[id]`) into a **single, unified, comprehensive Clinical & Lab Operating Workspace** ("One Patient, One Record, One Timeline"). This plan exhaustively maps every clinical, restorative, CAD/CAM, diagnostic, financial, logistical, and communication permutation to guarantee **zero loss of functionality**.

