### 6. Role-Based Permissions Permutations

| Feature / Action | Prescribing Dentist (`DENTIST`) | Lab Technician / Admin (`LAB_ADMIN`) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Patient Medical Records (EHR)** | Full access (Medical alerts, prescriptions, allergies, SOAP notes). | PHI-sanitized view (Patient age & gender only; HIPAA isolation). |
| **Manufacturing Stepper** | View-only progress tracking. | Interactive stage control (`Incoming ➔ Production ➔ QC ➔ Dispatched ➔ Delivered`). |
| **Order Chat Room** | Unlocked upon lab order acceptance; direct line to technician. | Unlocked upon order acceptance; direct line to prescribing doctor. |
| **CAD Soft-Copy Archiving** | Download & inspect final restorative mesh. | Upload final milled design files and Exocad project XMLs. |
| **Due Date Adjustments** | Propose target due date; accept/reject lab counter-proposals. | Propose alternative delivery dates based on milling capacity. |

